@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false

title CulCloud 第3章 非功能与安全需求约束图

rectangle "非功能需求" #E3F2FD {
  [可用性\n加载/成功/失败/空状态] as Availability
  [可维护性\n前后端模块化路由与服务] as Maintainability
  [演示稳定性\nPM2 + Docker Compose] as DemoStable
  [可观察性\n任务/日志/健康/分析] as Observability
}

rectangle "数据安全与合规边界" #FCE4EC {
  [最小必要采集\n文件名/对象路径/大小/类型/状态] as Minimal
  [路径安全\n_sanitize_path 拒绝 ..] as PathSafe
  [内容隔离\n预览与转换产物独立前缀] as Isolation
  [日志留痕边界\n不记录文件正文] as LogBoundary
  [演示角色隔离\nuser/admin 入口分离] as RoleBoundary
}

rectangle "代码落点" #FFF3E0 {
  [files.py/folders.py\n对象路径校验与 copy/delete] as FileCode
  [preview.py\npreviews/ 缓存与内容流] as PreviewCode
  [convert.py\nP0_WHITELIST + BackgroundTasks] as ConvertCode
  [task_queue.py/task_tracker.py\nRedis 任务状态] as TaskCode
  [log_collector.py\nlogs:recent + logs:timeline] as LogCode
  [health_checker.py\nhealth:current + health:history] as HealthCode
  [useDashboard.tsx\n角色与视图约束] as RoleCode
}

Availability --> ConvertCode
Availability --> TaskCode
Maintainability --> FileCode
Maintainability --> PreviewCode
DemoStable --> HealthCode
Observability --> TaskCode
Observability --> LogCode
Observability --> HealthCode

Minimal --> LogCode
PathSafe --> FileCode
PathSafe --> PreviewCode
Isolation --> PreviewCode
Isolation --> ConvertCode
LogBoundary --> LogCode
RoleBoundary --> RoleCode

note bottom
Redis 不可用时，任务状态、日志和健康历史存在降级或丢失风险；
MinIO 持久卷负责保存用户原文件、预览缓存和转换产物。
end note

@enduml
